{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows用attrib添加隐藏属性。对应需求：防御规避。官方：Adding Hidden File Attribute via Attrib。","from":"now-9m","index":["endgame-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-system.security*","logs-windows.forwarded*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","winlogbeat-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows用attrib添加隐藏属性","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows用attrib添加隐藏属性\n\n### 为何重要\n绕过防护、伪装或擦痕\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程、用户与事件ID。\n2. 核对路径、注册表、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与凭据操作。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件与账号。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","risk_score":21,"rule_id":"4630d948-40d4-4cef-ac69-4002e29bc3db","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 防御规避","来源: 默认","对应需求: 防御规避"],"timeline_id":"e70679c2-6cde-4510-9764-4823df18f7db","timeline_title":"Comprehensive Process Timeline","timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and\n  (process.name : \"attrib.exe\" or ?process.pe.original_file_name == \"ATTRIB.EXE\") and process.args : \"+h\" and\n  not (process.parent.name: \"cmd.exe\" and process.command_line: \"attrib  +R +H +S +A *.cui\") and\n\n  not (\n    process.parent.name: \"draw.io.exe\" and\n    (\n      process.command_line : (\"*drawio.bkp*\", \"*drawio.dtmp*\")\n    )\n  )\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1222","name":"File and Directory Permissions Modification","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1222/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1222.001","name":"Windows File and Directory Permissions Modification","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1222/001/"}]},{"id":"T1564","name":"Hide Artifacts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1564/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1564.001","name":"Hidden Files and Directories","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1564/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"system","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","message"]},"version":322,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now","references":[]}
